==Battleground==
*1 [[Cruel Angel Clionel]] spawns as the boss after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>.
*1 [[Hannya]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*4 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

